{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026nIgqH0Z3yn1793700842.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>網上流傳一段車Cam片段，顯示10月31日下午時分，旺角街頭出現電單車逆線行車的危險場面。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-03-18h08m06s789.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026YegGik1fI51793700802.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>片段顯示，涉事地點位於旺角衛理道與窩打老道交界。一名沒有佩戴頭盔的男司機駕駛電單車，載着一名女子在路段上逆線前行。當電單車駛入黃格交界轉彎時，迎面剛好有一輛紅色的士駛至。的士司機察覺異樣後即時緊急煞停避讓，電單車則順勢切線駛過。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-03-18h08m13s644.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026c621t0KGwN1793700808.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>相關片段引起網絡廣泛關注，許多網民指責該電單車司機違規駕駛，指其未戴頭盔且逆線載人，行為極度危險，紛紛留言指出：「麻煩樓主1823唔該」、「做佢啦！逆綫行車」，並有網民不滿表示：「啲電單車左穿右插，罔顧交通規矩」。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T01:45:20.621787+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":268,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T01:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T03:38:28.611108+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T01:38:39.300539+00:00","content_hash":"c37d807333ed39cf3bad467acc745895f6db0b7bf095a3c1f4bdd8a61d9e734d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}